TU1NZ Commercial S8.2 public observation and fail-closed rollback
Date: 2026-08-30
Decision: NO_GO_RETRY_REQUIRES_SEPARATE_REMEDIATION

Scope

- Public SFW Early Access only.
- No Adult media, AVS, payment, publishing or production capability was enabled.
- Observation evidence contains aggregate technical measurements only.

