- External SFW health: GREEN; forbidden capabilities remain false

Retry boundary

No second public S8 observation or activation is authorized by this evidence. A later
retry requires separately versioned remediation for bounded Telegram API outages,
fresh tests and CI, a fresh backup, and a new explicit activation decision.
